# Environment Configuration for AquaBalance

# API Configuration
# For production deployment, set this to your backend API URL
# Example: https://your-backend-api.herokuapp.com/api
REACT_APP_API_URL=

# Development Settings
# These are used automatically in development mode
# No need to set these for local development

# For AWS Amplify deployment:
# 1. Copy this file to .env.production
# 2. Set REACT_APP_API_URL to your deployed backend URL
# 3. Upload as environment variables in Amplify console

# For localhost presentations from hosted environment:
# Leave REACT_APP_API_URL empty and ensure your backend API
# has CORS configured to allow requests from your hosted domain